  "CRITERIA_MATCH_EXPLANATION": "This paper focuses on medical education in Africa, but it does not address regional curriculum harmonization initiatives across multiple countries or institutions. The focus is on the challenges and opportunities within medical education in Africa generally, not on specific regional harmonization efforts. There is no mention of regional frameworks, cross-border education, mutual recognition, credit transfer systems, or regional qualifications frameworks.",
